docs {
  Updates college onboarding/profile data.

  Notes:
  - Send tab data under `profileSections`.
  - Include all section keys used by the setup tabs:
    `college_overview`, `course_info`, `admission_policy`, `placements`,
    `fees`, `financial_aid`, `student_housing`, `exam_policy`, `faculty`,
    `review`, `commute`, `library`, `clubs_associations`,
    `student_code_of_conduct`, `happenings`, `institutions_across_world`,
    `alliance`, `other_courses_offered`, `demo_graphics`.
  - Keep list-like fields as arrays even for one item.
    Examples: `aminities`, `nearby_access.transit`, `campus_reels`,
    `courseAccolades`, `grading_scale`, `ratingDistribution`,
    `libraryHours`, `alliance.items`.

  Response shape:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "College profile updated",
    "data": {
      "collegeDetails": { ... },
      "tabs": ["college_overview", "course_info", "placements", ...],
      "totalCourses": 5,
      "instituteType": "Private University",
      "campusAmbassadors": []
    }
  }
  ```

  - `tabs` is a flat array of enabled profile section IDs.
    Disabled sections (where `enabled === false`) are excluded.
  - `collegeDetails` contains the full college object without raw `profileSections`.

  Requires: college-admin staff access token.
}

